# Beta Readiness Reminder

Every final agent response for this repository must end with a concise section titled:

`Beta Readiness Reminder`

Requirements:

1. Read `docs/BETA_READINESS.md` (canonical backlog).
2. List the highest-priority unresolved beta items (Blocker/Critical first).
3. Mention newly discovered blockers from the current task, if any.
4. Mention items completed by the current task, if any.
5. Never claim beta readiness without verification evidence.
6. Keep the section short and useful; link to `docs/BETA_READINESS.md`.

This rule must not change user-visible application behavior.
